<title>USA: Commonwealth completes Castech tender.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth completes Castech tender.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Aluminum Corp said it received about 98 percent of CasTech Aluminum Group Inc in its offer to acquire the company.</p>
<p>It said 12,650,418 shares of CasTech common stock were tendered at $20.50 per share cash.</p>
<p>Commonwealth said it expects to complete its acquisition of CasTech by converting the remaining shares of CasTechcommon into the right to receive $20.50 per share.</p>
</text>
